<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκῡρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without authority</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύριος</span>, hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> of laws, sentences, etc., <i>invalid,
				unratified, obsolete</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήφισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					954e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνθῆκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					18.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκυρον ποιεῖν,
			καταστῆσαι</span> set <i>aside</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				356d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				1.21
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμοις ἀ. χρωμένη</span>
			<i>not enforcing</i> the laws, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.37
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					168.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>having no right</i> or <i>power</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ποιεῖν τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.3.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθιστάναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					9.19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>
			<i>over</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				169e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πάντων . . γενήσεσθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.2
				</span></i>
			 : c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				929e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκυροτέρα κρίσις</span>
			<i>less trust-worthy</i> decision, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				178d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἀμφορεύς</span> voting urn
				<i>into which neutral votes were thrown</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1150
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.123
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀκυρότερα</span>
			<i>less important</i> parts of nature, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				778a1
			</span></i>; of bodily members, <i>unimportant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. μόριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					16.540
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18(1).33
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); <i>impotent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				772b28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of words and
			phrases, <i>used in improper sense</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Fam.</u>
				16.17.1
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				717.12
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					12.3.23
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.161
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Meth.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				306
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
